.SS General Options
These options apply to all dialogs where applicable.
.TP
.BI --title= TITLE
Set the dialog title.
.TP
.BI --width= WIDTH
Set the width (0 = default).
.TP
.BI --height= HEIGHT
Set the height (0 = fit the content).
.TP
.BI --timeout= SECONDS
Set dialog timeout in seconds. On timeout the dialog closes and
exit status 5 is returned on timeout.
.TP
.BI --ok-label= TEXT
Set the label of the OK button (default: OK).
.TP
.BI --cancel-label= TEXT
Set the label of the Cancel button (default: Cancel).
.TP
.BI --extra-button= TEXT
Add an extra button. May be repeated.
.TP
.B --modal
Set the modal hint.
.TP
.BI --attach= WINDOW
DEPRECATED; does nothing. Kept for script compatibility.
