.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
.B cosmic-wicara --question --title="Confirm" --text="Proceed?"
May be used in shell scripts inside a COSMIC session.
.TP
.B cosmic-wicara --entry --title="Login" --text="Enter name:"
Prints the entered text on stdout.
.TP
.B cosmic-wicara --file-selection --directory --multiple
Prints selected paths, one per line.
.TP
.B cosmic-wicara --progress --pulsate --title="Working"
Reads percentage lines on stdin and updates the progress bar.
.TP
.B cosmic-wicara --notification --text="Done" --icon=dialog-information
Displays a desktop notification bubble.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
OK, help, or --version.
.TP
.B 1
Cancel, window close, or timeout.
.TP
.B 255
Error: missing dialog type, more than one dialog type, or
unrecognized option.
.SH BUGS
Report bugs against cosmic-wicara. This tool mirrors only the CLI of
